  ("Nouns referring to most of the animals not included in the preceding sections are of fixed, arbi-" 0.0920 0.9082 0.3115 0.3279 0.3279 0.0165 0.00482 0.3222 0.0575 "UFSJES+Palatino-Roman" 0.0136 nil nil 0)
  ("trary gender which must be learned separately. The gender of the noun has nothing to do with" 0.0920 0.9081 0.3280 0.3444 0.3444 0.0165 0.00482 0.2988 0.0418 "UFSJES+Palatino-Roman" 0.0136 nil nil 0)
  ("the sex of the animal:" 0.0920 0.2724 0.3444 0.3609 0.3609 0.0165 0.00482 0.3691 0.0267 "UFSJES+Palatino-Roman" 0.0136 nil nil 0)
  ("la araña spider" 0.1092 0.2305 0.3731 0.3896 0.3896 0.0165 0.00482 0.2755 0.0139 "UFSJES+Palatino-Italic" 0.0136 nil t 0)
  ("la babosa slug" 0.1092 0.2198 0.3896 0.4061 0.4061 0.0165 0.00482 0.2500 0.0139 "UFSJES+Palatino-Italic" 0.0136 nil t 0)
