  ("Exceptions: la flor ‘flower’, la labor ‘labour’. El hambre ‘hunger’ is also feminine: see 3.1.2 for an" 0.0920 0.9081 0.5838 0.6003 0.6003 0.0165 0.00482 0.3114 0.0991 "UFSJES+Palatino-Roman" 0.0136 nil nil 0)
